title: AWS v2 RDS: Replication Slot
agents: aws_v2
catalog: cloud/aws
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors the replication slot disk usage of
 AWS/RDS (PostgreSQL databases only).

 To make this check work you have to configure the related
 special agent {Amazon Web Services (AWS) v2}.

 No default levels are set. Upper levels are configurable via the
 rule "AWS v2/RDS Disk Usage".

item:
 Name of the instance and region name (to avoid duplicate services
 in case of multi-region monitoring).

discovery:
 One service is created for each database if all required metrics
 (ReplicationSlotDiskUsage) are given.
